<section class="panel overview-explanation"><h2>What these totals include</h2><p>Known tests are explicitly documented synthetic registrations. Other registrations are unclassified and may include trials or additional tests; they are not a verified customer count. Counts include each registration once, regardless of business memberships.</p><p>Business setup and associations use live records only; preview setup is excluded. User registration is shared across environments and does not mean a business is set up. No active-business, completed-setup, revenue or platform-health claim is made.</p></section>
<h2>Business setup stages</h2><p class="muted">Each business appears in one stage. Published means a public page exists, not that bookings are ready.</p><section class="stats overview-stages" aria-label="Business setup totals"><?php foreach(PlatformDirectory::stages() as $key=>$label):if($key==='all')continue;?><article><span><?=$label?></span><strong><?=$data['businesses']['all'][$key]?></strong><small>Known tests: <?=$data['businesses']['known_test'][$key]?> · Other: <?=$data['businesses']['other'][$key]?></small><a href="platform-directory-page.php?view=businesses&amp;stage=<?=$key?>">View <?=strtolower($label)?></a></article><?php endforeach;?></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>User registration facts</h2><dl class="overview-facts"><?php foreach(['verified'=>'Email verified','unverified'=>'Email unverified','no_business'=>'No live business association'] as $key=>$label):?><div><dt><?=$label?></dt><dd><?=$data['users']['all'][$key]?> <small>(known tests <?=$data['users']['known_test'][$key]?> · other <?=$data['users']['other'][$key]?>)</small></dd></div><?php endforeach;?></dl><p class="muted">Email confirmation does not establish business readiness or activity. No-business users can overlap either verification group.</p><a href="platform-directory-page.php?view=users">Review user registrations</a></section>
